msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:309
msgid ""
"Check if the loaded library version exports the function: `nm /usr/lib/"
"libwgpu_dawn.so | grep wgpuFunctionName`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:311
